# Reviewed exceptions for .agents/bin/precheck.sh
#
# One glob per line. Format: <check>:<path>      (# starts a comment)
#   artifact:dist/bundle.js       a tracked build output that is deliberate
#   size:test/fixtures/big.bin    an intentionally large test fixture
#   secret-soft:tests/*           credential-shaped test values that are known fakes
#   licence:                      licence decision is known and accepted as absent
#
# Checks: artifact · env · size · secret · secret-soft · conflict · swallowed · debugger ·
#         machine-path · gitignore · licence · lockfile · ci · readme · readme-quickstart ·
#         constitution · agents-length · profile · memory · commands · command-<id> ·
#         changelog · security-policy · tag
#
# Every exception is a permanent, visible decision. Prefer fixing the finding.

# Vendored skill helpers (browser companion scripts) use empty catch blocks by design;
# they are agent tooling, not application code.
swallowed:.agents/skills/*
